#html-body [data-pb-style=XRL5QJS]{justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-position:left top;background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-attachment:scroll}Gucci Flora Gorgeous Magnolia Eau de Parfum is a captivating floral fragrance with Patchouli, Magnolia and Dewberries.
 This perfume is built around Magnolia Essence, emanating a bright, floral sweetness and an exquisite feminine dimension, while a Dewberries Accord lends an irresistible fruity quality. This tantalising balance of fresh and sensual notes is enhanced by the woodiness of Patchouli Essence, which grounds the scent with a subtle, earthy facet.
 The floral elements of this Gucci scent are magnified by the soft and sensual hues of Blond Woods, while a Coconut Accord offers an addictive and sweet freshness. Finally, Jasmine Sambac Absolute and a trail of Musks combine to offer an enticing warmth. A beautiful fragrance that lasts all day long and will attract compliments every time you wear it.&nbsp;
